{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:NuclearInteractions.LpConfined","@type":"LeanModule","name":"NuclearInteractions.LpConfined","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Fin.Basic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPConfined.lpStable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPConfined.lpStable","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-confined.lean#L40-L44","doc":"An LP-confined element is in particular LP-stable. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPConfined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPConfined","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-confined.lean#L32-L38","doc":"An element `x` is **LP-confined** for Gram matrix `G` relative to a\nfamily of proper sub-braid coordinate vectors `subBraids` iff `x`\nitself is LP-stable and none of the proper sub-braids is LP-stable. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:lp-confined","label":"def:lp-confined","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-confined.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPStable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.LPStable","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-confined.lean#L27-L30","doc":"`x` is **LP-stable** for Gram matrix `G` iff `G x ≥ 0` componentwise. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:lp-stable","label":"def:lp-stable","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-stable.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.GramMatrix","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.GramMatrix","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-confined.lean#L24-L25","doc":"The Gram matrix `G_ij = tr_M(b_i · b_j)` on the 6 NF basis elements. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.H3Vector","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.H3Vector","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/lp-confined.lean#L21-L22","doc":"An element of `H₃(q)` is recorded by its 6-vector of NF coordinates. ","signatureChunk":0}]}